<!-- formalization -->

**Definition (`InfoSys.mkLeft`).** For $x \in D_{\mathbf{A}}$, the left injection token is $(x, \Delta_{\mathbf{B}})$ with the corresponding half-left product witness.

**Definition (`InfoSys.mkLeft.instLeftCommutativeInsert`).** Inserting left-injection tokens commutes on the left when building finite sets of product tokens.
